        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-900">11. Limitation of Liability for Transactions</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, BREEDERHQ DOES NOT ASSUME RESPONSIBILITY FOR LOSSES, INCLUDING DIRECT DAMAGES, TO THE EXTENT CAUSED BY THE ACTS, OMISSIONS, OR REPRESENTATIONS OF A PROVIDER, A BUYER, OR A THIRD PARTY, AND NOT BY BREEDERHQ. Examples include:</p>
        <ul class="mb-4 ml-6 list-disc space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM ANIMAL HEALTH ISSUES, DEATH, OR INJURY;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM MISREPRESENTATION BY A PROVIDER OR BUYER;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM FAILED, INCOMPLETE, OR DISPUTED TRANSACTIONS;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM PAYMENT PROCESSING ERRORS OR DISPUTES;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM TRANSPORTATION OR DELIVERY ISSUES;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM SERVICES RENDERED BY ANY PROVIDER;</li><li>LOSSES RESULTING FROM A PROVIDER'S FALSE OR INACCURATE CREDENTIAL ATTESTATION OR INAUTHENTIC SUPPORTING DOCUMENTATION.</li></ul>
        <p class="mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>Nothing in this Section creates liability for BreederHQ. Any liability BreederHQ has notwithstanding this Section is governed exclusively by §4.3 of the Terms of Service, including its exclusions, aggregate cap, carve-outs, and consumer-rights savings.</strong> In case of any conflict between this Section and §4.3 of the Terms of Service, §4.3 controls.</p>
